{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Face to face, etc.</b> The reason for his wonder is not that he saw an angel — for Elohim had revealed Himself to him previously — but rather that he wrestled with the angel. And his saying ״פָּנִים אֶל פָּנִים״ is an expression of battle, along the lines of (II Kings 14:8) ״נִתְרָאֶה פָנִים״."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:45:40.130235317Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}